<view class="page">
  <view class="privacy" wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}">
    <text class="privacy-title">查询前请先了解这两件事</text>
    <text class="privacy-copy">手机号由你手动输入，只发给自己配置的服务器，用来精确查找已录入的订阅单号。不读取微信绑定的手机号，结果里也不回显手机号、姓名或地址。</text>
    <text class="privacy-copy">打开快递公司小程序前，会把对应单号写入剪贴板。微信把 wx.setClipboardData 和读取剪贴板列在同一项隐私说明里。本程序只写入单号，不读取剪贴板，也不把手机号发给快递公司。</text>
    <view class="row">
      <button class="btn ghost" bindtap="onOpenContract">查看隐私指引</button>
      <button
        id="agree-btn"
        class="btn primary"
        open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization"
        bindagreeprivacyauthorization="onAgreePrivacy"
      >同意并继续</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="brand">
    <text class="brand-mark">刊邮</text>
    <view class="brand-text">
      <text class="title">杂志邮寄单号查询</text>
      <text class="disclaimer">按完整手机号查看已录入的快递单号。不是任何杂志社或快递公司的官方客户端。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="goldbar">
    <text>填写收件手机号。结果只有杂志、日期、邮寄方式和单号。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="box">
    <text class="box-title">查询单号</text>
    <view class="box-body">
      <text class="label">手机号</text>
      <input
        class="field"
        type="text"
        maxlength="24"
        placeholder="请输入完整手机号"
        value="{{phone}}"
        bindinput="onPhoneInput"
        disabled="{{status === 'loading'}}"
      />
      <text class="hint">需要全部数字。空格和 +86 可以留着，系统按完整号码精确匹配。</text>
      <text class="error" wx:if="{{status === 'invalid'}}">{{message}}</text>
      <button class="btn primary block" bindtap="onLookup" disabled="{{status === 'loading' || showPrivacy}}">
        {{status === 'loading' ? '正在查询' : '查询单号'}}
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="box">
    <text class="box-title">到官方小程序查询</text>
    <view class="box-body">
      <text class="hint">韵达、中通、中国邮政 EMS 都只打开首页。有对应单号时会先复制，再请你在对方页面粘贴。没有核实到可自动带单号的路径。</text>
      <view class="row">
        <button
          class="btn primary"
          wx:for="{{carriers}}"
          wx:key="id"
          bindtap="onOpenCarrier"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          disabled="{{showPrivacy}}"
        >{{item.button}}</button>
      </view>
      <text class="hint" wx:if="{{carrierMessage}}">{{carrierMessage}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{demoWarning}}" class="banner">{{demoWarning}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="panel">正在查询，请稍候。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'empty'}}" class="panel">
    <text class="panel-title">没有找到邮寄记录</text>
    <text class="panel-copy">{{message}}</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'limited'}}" class="panel bad">
    <text class="panel-title">查询过于频繁</text>
    <text class="panel-copy">{{message}}</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'error' || status === 'config'}}" class="panel bad">
    <text class="panel-title">{{status === 'config' ? '还不能查询' : '查询没有完成'}}</text>
    <text class="panel-copy">{{message}}</text>
    <button wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" class="btn ghost block" bindtap="onLookup">再试一次</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'results'}}">
    <text class="result-head">找到 {{shipments.length}} 条邮寄记录</text>
    <text class="hint">按寄出日期从新到旧。这里没有物流轨迹。</text>
    <view class="card" wx:for="{{shipments}}" wx:key="key">
      <text class="card-title">{{item.magazineName}}</text>
      <view class="card-body">
        <text class="stamp" wx:if="{{item.sample}}">虚构示例</text>
        <text class="meta">寄出日期 {{item.dateText}}</text>
        <text class="meta">邮寄方式 {{item.shippingMethod}}</text>
        <text class="fine">快递单号</text>
        <text class="tracking" user-select="{{true}}">{{item.trackingNumber}}</text>
        <view class="row">
          <button class="btn ghost" bindtap="onCopy" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{showPrivacy}}">复制单号</button>
          <button
            wx:if="{{item.showJump}}"
            class="btn primary"
            bindtap="onJump"
            data-index="{{index}}"
            disabled="{{showPrivacy}}"
          >打开{{item.jump.carrierName}}</button>
        </view>
        <text class="notice" wx:if="{{item.showJump}}">{{item.jump.notice}}</text>
        <text class="hint" wx:if="{{!item.showJump}}">{{item.jump.notice}}</text>
        <text class="ok" wx:if="{{item.copyMessage}}">{{item.copyMessage}}</text>
        <text class="hint" wx:if="{{item.jumpMessage}}">{{item.jumpMessage}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="hint" wx:if="{{truncated}}">只显示最近 100 条。</text>
  </view>
</view>
